# Designer hand-off archives land in handoff/, which is ignored whole. design/ holds only the
# design the plugin is CURRENTLY built from, so the two never have to be told apart by timestamp:
# handoff/ is what arrived, design/ is what is in use, and the merge from one to the other is the
# deliberate step between them.
#
# design/*.zip stays as a guard, not because archives go there any more. Dropping one in design/ was
# the habit for a long time, and an untracked stray is cheaper than a 15MB binary committed by
# reflex.
#
# design/assets/ must stay TRACKED: the plate, both knob filmstrips, the icon ladder and the three
# embedded fonts are build inputs.
design/*.zip
handoff/

# Prompt logs are personal working notes, not project documentation. Any decision that matters
# belongs in a code comment beside what it governs, or in this repo's CLAUDE.md - never only in a
# prompt, where nobody will find it.
prompts/
